{"game":"pmbstyle-L2Solo","category":"vfx-blood-finishers","cell":2,"verdict":"STRONG","depth":"full","donor_path":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/pmbstyle-L2Solo/src/GameServer/Bot/AI/BotEmergencyFinisher.js","licence":"Apache-2.0 (LICENSE: Apache License, Version 2.0, January 2004; package.json: SEE LICENSE IN LICENSE)","licence_class":"permissive","target_module":"src/fight/finisher.ts","parity_row":9,"pattern_tags":["new:finisher-commit-gate","new:kill-window","new:incoming-budget","new:survival-reserve","hate-table"],"data_fields":[{"name":"finisher_window_ms","donor_constant":"4000","unit":"ms","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/pmbstyle-L2Solo/src/GameServer/Bot/AI/BotEmergencyFinisher.js:11"},{"name":"finisher_damage_margin","donor_constant":"0.70","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/pmbstyle-L2Solo/src/GameServer/Bot/AI/BotEmergencyFinisher.js:12"},{"name":"basic_finisher_max_hits","donor_constant":"2","unit":"count","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/pmbstyle-L2Solo/src/GameServer/Bot/AI/BotEmergencyFinisher.js:55"},{"name":"skill_finisher_pad_ms","donor_constant":"1000 (fixed in donor)","unit":"ms","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/pmbstyle-L2Solo/src/GameServer/Bot/AI/BotEmergencyFinisher.js:80"},{"name":"incoming_headroom","donor_constant":"1.5","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/pmbstyle-L2Solo/src/GameServer/Bot/AI/BotEmergencyFinisher.js:105"},{"name":"survival_reserve_ratio","donor_constant":"0.10 of max HP, minimum 1 HP","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/pmbstyle-L2Solo/src/GameServer/Bot/AI/BotEmergencyFinisher.js:107"},{"name":"threat_radius","donor_constant":"2500","unit":"units","where":"zone data","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/pmbstyle-L2Solo/src/GameServer/Bot/AI/BotEmergencyFinisher.js:13"},{"name":"threat_memory_ms","donor_constant":"5000","unit":"ms","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/pmbstyle-L2Solo/src/GameServer/Bot/AI/BotEmergencyFinisher.js:90"},{"name":"swing_time_ms_below_speed_2","donor_constant":"2700","unit":"ms","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/pmbstyle-L2Solo/src/GameServer/Formulas.js:241"},{"name":"emergency_hp_ratio","donor_constant":"0.35","unit":"ratio","where":"engine constant","donor_ref":"/mnt/frankendom-donors/pmbstyle-L2Solo/src/GameServer/Bot/AI/States/HuntingState.js:35"}],"best_idea":"Commit to a finishing blow only when the predicted kill lands inside a short window and the attacker's HP after every swing the enemies can land in that window stays above a reserve; otherwise retreat.","decision":"adapt","decision_why":"The commit gate (time window, fastest option first, incoming budget with headroom, survival reserve) gives the finishers lane a server-side rule for when a finisher is granted; the bot code and its snapshot threat list and fixed skill pad are not used as they are. The donor has no visual finisher, so the presentation is Frankendom's own.","decision_status":"proposed","acceptance":"A server test with the player at 30% HP and a monster at 20% HP that dies in two basic hits grants the finisher only if HP after the predicted exchange stays above 10% of max; with a second monster casting or in the threat list the finisher is refused and the player retreats. The player sees the finisher only when the server grants it."}
